# kernel RPM pins for the 7.2.5 proof container
#
# Format: <sha256>  <filename>  <url>
#
# These four RPMs are the kernel release shipped by the pinned Bluefin digest
# (sha256:23b7bf54…2bc9, ostree.linux = 7.2.5-200.fc44.x86_64). The release has aged out
# of the Fedora 44 repositories, so they come from koji. `rpm -K` verifies payload
# digests only: RSAHEADER/SIGPGP are (none), i.e. no Fedora GPG signature. Provenance is
# therefore HTTPS to koji plus these hashes — a pinned hash, not a skipped check
# (research/findings/module-pipeline.md §1, design §12 open question 5).
#
# Fetch with scripts/fetch-kernel-rpms.sh; it re-hashes after download and refuses a
# mismatch. Do not edit a hash to make a download pass.
